<title>AUSTRALIA: Wills half yr net rises to A$12.88 mln.</title>
<headline>Wills half yr net rises to A$12.88 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    21.72 vs  16.41</p>
<p>    Net				     12.88 vs   6.10</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (cents)	   3.0  vs  nil</p>
<p>NOTE: W.D. &amp; H.O. Wills Holdings Ltd  WHW AX is a cigarette maker and is about 67 percent owned by B.A.T. Industries Plc</p>
<p>    Sales				  473.69 vs 487.45</p>
<p>    Other income			   2.51 vs   4.86</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    9.8  vs   4.6</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil  vs loss 6.16</p>
<p>Dividend is franked at 36 percent</p>
<p>Pay date Aug 21</p>
<p>Reg date Aug 13</p>
<p>    Tax					8.34 vs   3.86</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.52 vs   2.96</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  15.31 vs  15.16</p>
<p>    Minorities			     0.51 vs   0.28</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
